Sensor: Sony IMX487 (UV Image Sensor)
Key specifications

Diagonal size: 11.1 mm (Type 2/3) format. 

Effective pixel count: ~8.13 megapixels (2856 H × 2848 V) 

Pixel size: 2.74 µm × 2.74 µm 

Shutter type: Global shutter — uses Sony’s “Pregius S” back-illuminated pixel structure. 

UV wavelength compatibility: 200-400 nm (target industrial UV range) 

Read-out / frame rates (full resolution, all-pixel scan):

8 bit: ~194 fps 

10 bit: ~193 fps 

12 bit: ~127 fps 


Interfaces: SLVS-EC (8/4/2/1 lanes) and SLVS (8/4 channels) for high-speed output. 


Power supply typical: Analog: 3.3 V / 2.9 V; Digital: 1.1 V; Interface: 1.8 V. 


Package: Ceramic LGA, ~20.0 × 16.8 mm
I2C control plane protocol
using 4-lane MIPI CSI-2 (USB 3.0, )